Yes, you can leave those clicks out by adding a `transformRequest` option to the `plausible.init` call in your snippet [1]. Replace `yoursite.com` with your own domain [1]:

```javascript
plausible.init({
  // ... Other initialization options
  transformRequest: function (payload) {
    if (payload.n === 'Outbound Link: Click' && payload.p && payload.p.url) {
      var host = new URL(payload.p.url).hostname
      if (host === 'yoursite.com' || host.endsWith('.yoursite.com')) {
        return null
      }
    }
    return payload
  }
})
```
To leave clicks that were already recorded out of your reports, filter by the **url** property with "does not contain" and your domain [1].

